                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                langAttribute="none"
                                text="&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Annette joined Abbott/AbbVie in 2011 as Head of Regulatory Affairs Switzerland, and was appointed Director of Regulatory Affairs Switzerland in 2013. In 2018, she took on the role of Director of Regulatory Affairs, South Europe Region. After several years as Therapy Area Head, Regulatory for EyeCare and Toxins within AbbVie’s European organization, she returned to Switzerland in 2026 as Director of Regulatory Affairs. Before joining AbbVie, Annette worked in regulatory affairs at several international pharmaceutical companies. Annette holds a master’s degree in molecular and cellular biology from the University of Basel.&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
